infinite-patch 1
# Future Garage Sub Reese Bass Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 44
  i note1 44
  i note2 47
  i note3 51
  i note4 44
  i note5 47
